# Packages that are only some dependency's peer stay in the lock file but are
# not installed. The one this is for is electron-builder-squirrel-windows, a
# peer of app-builder-lib that npm would otherwise install unasked: it brings
# electron-winstaller, whose vendor/ holds 7-Zip 16.04 and 20.02 executables
# that every scanner reports, and electron-builder loads it only for a
# Squirrel.Windows target, which this project does not build (NSIS and
# portable). A peer something here does need goes in devDependencies, as
# @testing-library/dom does for @testing-library/react.
omit=peer
